      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im doing some research for a case study. if a big public company decides to pivot their strategy to focus heavily on ESG goals—like aggressive carbon neutrality and diversifying their board for social justice reasons—what kind of long-term impact does that usually have on their shareholder value and overall business stability?",
